              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "He went out a peddling—unless maybe he can't sell his head.",
              "speaker": "Peter Coffin",
              "balloon_zone": "top_center",
              "speaker_region": "right",
              "source_evidence": "“to-night he went out a peddling... unless, may be, he can’t sell his head.”"
