          "source_frame_number": 6,
          "texts": [
            {
              "kind": "caption",
              "text": "Dozing at last, I saw the harpooneer come in with a New Zealand head, undress to tattooed squares, set a little wooden idol in the fireplace, burn shavings and biscuit, and sing out in strange gutturals.",
